          "body": "Australia's second Bledisloe Test against New Zealand in Sydney could reshuffle the top of the men's rankings with France in the frame. Planet Rugby's permutations have France fourth on 87.43 points, and a Wallabies win by more than 15 points would move Australia above them. Australia come off a 50-19 defeat at Eden Park and a 12-match losing streak against the All Blacks, which makes that margin a tall order."
